uired).\n4. **7th Layer Gate Latency:** Identity gate checks run at **250 nanoseconds (0.25 μs) P99**, executing 4,000× faster than the 1.0 ms SLA.\n5. **Full Suite Verification:** All **52/52 Python E2E tests** and **4/4 Zig bare-metal hardware tests** pass at 100%.\n\nThe complete audit is documented in [`docs/audits/UNCONSTRAINED_BFT_SWARM_SCALING_AND_BREAKING_POINT_REPORT.md`](file:///Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/docs/audits/UNCONSTRAINED_BFT_SWARM_SCALING_AND_BREAKING_POINT_REPORT.md).\n\n<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE -->"}
